  "title": "My Crispy Mashed Potato Pancake",
  "description": "Make these mashed potato pancakes with leftover mashed potatoes and easy pantry ingredients for golden brown crisp potato pancakes every time!",
  "authors": [
    "LINDASGARDENSIDE"
  ],
  "date_published": "2019-04-02T02:57:34-04:00",
