  "ingredients": [
    "2 cups cold mashed potatoes",
    "4 tablespoons potato starch",
    "2 eggs, lightly beaten",
    "3/4 teaspoon kosher salt",
    "1/4 teaspoon ground black pepper",
    "0.125 teaspoon garlic powder",
    "1 tablespoon chopped fresh chives",
    "1 tablespoon vegetable oil",
    "cooking spray"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/nwXbFluB8mPWzZvkW-uyqJKG5kA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/222608-my-crispy-mashed-potato-pancake-DDMFS-001-9551320bd6fe490a98fb2433c3dd5e64.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/222608/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mix together mashed potatoes, potato starch, egg, salt, pepper, garlic powder, and 1 teaspoon of the chives in a medium bowl until combined. The mixture should be slightly sticky but not loose.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/X4hjD_1XGqpbGjTW26O-U7iEWMs=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/222608-my-crispy-mashed-potato-pancake-DDMFS-002-b8a256394e51481f977e34b036071814.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/222608/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Heat 1 tablespoon of the oil in a 10-inch nonstick skillet over medium-high heat until hot and oil is fragrant. Spoon potato mixture into skillet and press it into an even layer to create a potato pancake about 9 inches in diameter.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/M2HPmMQvnonQpYhQsdhFaExkyGE=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/222608-my-crispy-mashed-potato-pancake-DDMFS-003-a7201ed921d7456fbd8e962dbcd8719b.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/222608/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Reduce heat to medium; cover skillet with a lid or flat cookie sheet and cook, giving skillet a 90-degree turn every 2 to 3 minutes, until golden brown around the edges and top of pancake feels almost dry to the touch, 8 to 9 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/-lnU71Fc6InSxI-uAsbzuRAYhIY=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/222608-my-crispy-mashed-potato-pancake-DDMFS-004-258f30ff70234afaa6627c85c1610b56.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/222608/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Slide potato pancake onto a large plate. Spray another large plate with nonstick cooking spray and invert the potato pancake onto greased plate.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/5jjcgO6CfmQt0EKrDB6Ay7WH5Ds=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/222608-my-crispy-mashed-potato-pancake-DDMFS-005-c972edc2b9ff4b3a8043d37802265f3a.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/222608/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add remaining 1 teaspoon oil to skillet and heat over medium. Slide pancake back into skillet and cook, uncovered, until golden brown on the other side, about 5 more minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/hEWghdzgdjTMQulNusm2u6KruII=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/222608-my-crispy-mashed-potato-pancake-DDMFS-006-7f3eb25cf23d40769b5f809540090554.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/222608/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Slide pancake onto a cutting board and garnish with remaining 1 teaspoon chives.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Ry88U5wGNl8IpD_dae-er76jGkY=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/222608-my-crispy-mashed-potato-pancake-DDMFS-007-4fe59029838d472cbd752ba26460b1a3.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/222608/step_07.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Slice into 8 wedges and serve immediately. Enjoy!",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/7zJC-EaE2qito0GI2FPPUqRIy2k=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/222608-my-crispy-mashed-potato-pancake-DDMFS-011-4x3-e5e08fb093884ce0827e8bb3914300dc.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/222608/step_08.webp"
    }
  ],
